{"q": 22317, "quiz": 2035, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Where does Professor Otto Lidenbrock teach geology?", "why": "في النص جامعتان تتنافسان، والمطلوب جامعة العمّ: «Otto Lidenbrock is the famous professor of geology at the University of Hamburg, in Germany.» أما جامعة ريكيافيك فلغيره: «Mr Fridriksson, a professor from the university there, met us at the boat.»", "opts": [{"t": "In a small town in Norway.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "In Hamburg, in Germany.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "In Stromboli, in Italy.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "In Reykjavik, in Iceland.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
