{"q": 22319, "quiz": 2035, "obj": "P2.WORD_CONTEXT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In the tunnels, the professor wants to find a \"spring\". What is a spring here?", "why": "المعنى من السياق القريب: انتهى الماء «Unluckily, our water finished.» فقال العمّ «We're going to find a spring. There are many, but we have to go down further.» ثم «Axel, please. We are going to find water.»", "opts": [{"t": "A tool that makes holes in rock.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A place with water under the ground.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "The time of year after winter.", "dx": "GAP", "key": false}, {"t": "A tunnel that goes up to the top.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}]},
{"q": 22320, "quiz": 2035, "obj": "P3.COMPARE_CHAR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "How are the professor and Axel different on the journey?", "why": "المقارنة في أمر واحد عبر النص كله — المضيّ في الرحلة: يقول أكسل «Then, we can go home?» و«We can't go on, uncle. It's too hot.» ويجيب العمّ «We must.» ثم «I did not come all this way to turn back now.»", "opts": [{"t": "Axel always wants to go on, but the professor often wants to stop.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "The professor almost never speaks, but Axel talks all the time.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The professor is the strongest of the three, but Axel is the best climber.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The professor always wants to go on, but Axel often wants to stop.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 22321, "quiz": 2035, "obj": "P4.FIT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In the last line of the book, Hans is quiet again. Is this last line right for Hans?", "why": "الخاتمة تفي بما رسمه النص لهانس من أوله: «He almost never smiled or spoke.» وفي آخر سطر: «But, as usual, the quiet Icelander didn't say a word.»", "opts": [{"t": "Yes. Hans is angry with the professor at the end.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Hans almost never speaks in the story.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "No. Hans talks a lot in the tunnels and on the boat.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "No. Hans is not at the train station at the end.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
