{"q": 17211, "quiz": 1183, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In Section 1, Nick reads about the Eyes of Montezuma. Where did they first come from?", "why": "في الفقرة بلدان تتنافس، وإسبانيا أقربها، والمطلوب المنشأ الأول: «They came from Mexico about two hundred years ago»", "opts": [{"t": "From Morocco.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "From Mexico.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "From England.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "From Spain.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17212, "quiz": 1183, "obj": "P2.MOTIVE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In Section 2, Nick saw a bag on the back seat of the blue Renault. Why did Nick follow the car?", "why": "الدافع من سلوكه في الفقرة نفسها: رأى «On the back seat there was a bag with the letters U.C.L.A. on the side.» وهي «Shelley's university.» فقرّر أن يتبع السيارة.", "opts": [{"t": "The bag had a gun and some ropes in it.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The bag was Clare's, from her work at the hospital.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The bag had the letters of Shelley's university on it.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "The bag had the two famous earrings in it.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17213, "quiz": 1183, "obj": "P2.UNSIGNALLED", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In Section 1, Shelley talks about her little yellow Fiat. Why did she choose this car?", "why": "السبب في الجملة التالية لسؤالها بلا أداة ربط: «I'm STM - Shelley Theresa Marn. - and the letters on the car are STM, too!»", "opts": [{"t": "Her parents have a yellow car like it.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "It was a good car for the long roads in Spain.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Its letters are the first letters of her name.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Yellow is the colour of her university.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17214, "quiz": 1183, "obj": "P3.CHANGE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "At the start of Section 2, the Eyes of Montezuma disappear from the museum. How is this different at the end of the story?", "why": "التغيّر بين أول القسم الثاني وآخر القصة وما أحدثه: «disappeared from the Prado Museum» ثم «one of the fire-fighters found the diamonds in the plane» فعادت «back in their glass case again».", "opts": [{"t": "Blane took them on a plane, and they are in Morocco now.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Jose found them, and they are with his family again.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A fire-fighter found them, and they are back in their glass case.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "The police found them, and they are in a villa near Toledo.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17215, "quiz": 1183, "obj": "P4.FIT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "At the end, Clare says, \"This time, Nick and I are coming with you.\" Why is this a good end for the story?", "why": "الخاتمة تردّ على أول القصة: هناك «But Shelley Marn didn't come back after two minutes, or ten, or twenty.» وهنا تقول كلير ضاحكةً «This time, Nick and I are coming with you.»", "opts": [{"t": "Clare thinks Shelley wants to take the diamonds.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Clare is afraid of the reporters outside the museum.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "On the ship, Shelley went to her car and did not come back.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "On the ship, Clare went to her car and left her bag there.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17216, "quiz": 1183, "obj": "P4.CONSEQUENCE", "kind": "relabel"},
{"q": 17487, "quiz": 1229, "obj": "P1.PARAPHRASE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In Chapter 1, what is Professor Aronnax's work?", "why": "السؤال يعيد صياغة قوله في أول الفصل: «My job is to study everything dead or alive under the sea.»", "opts": [{"t": "He studies life under the sea.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "He is the captain of an American ship.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "He is the assistant of a famous writer.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "He is a famous whale killer.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17488, "quiz": 1229, "obj": "P2.UNSIGNALLED", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "At the end of Chapter 4, the cannibals touch the ship, scream and swim away. The Professor is terrified then. Why?", "why": "السبب في الجمل التالية بلا أداة ربط: «There is electricity around that door.» ثم «He also had everything he needed to keep us prisoners.»", "opts": [{"t": "The cannibals can come back in the night.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The Captain wants to kill all the cannibals.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The electricity hurt Ned Land and Conseil.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The electricity can stop him and his friends too.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 17489, "quiz": 1229, "obj": "P2.WORD_CONTEXT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In Chapter 10, the Nautilus is in a \"whirlpool\". What is a whirlpool in this story?", "why": "المعنى من السياق القريب: «The Nautilus suddenly began to turn round in circles.» ثم «Boats which sailed into these whirlpools never escaped.»", "opts": [{"t": "Black ink. It comes out of a giant squid.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A hole in the rock. Ships go through it.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Dangerous water. It turns boats round in circles.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "A big wave. It comes from an underwater volcano.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17490, "quiz": 1229, "obj": "P3.CHANGE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "For nine months, the Nautilus was the Professor's home. How did this change at the end of the story?", "why": "التغيّر بين حاله على السفينة وحاله في الخاتمة وما أحدثه: «This was my home for nine months.» ثم «The whirlpool threw our boat away from the Nautilus. Some fishermen found us and took us to the shore.»", "opts": [{"t": "Ned Land killed the Captain's men, and the three friends swam to the shore.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Captain Nemo opened the door, and the men sailed the small boat to Norway.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "The enemy ship hit the Nautilus, and its sailors took the men home.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The sea threw the small boat away, and fishermen took the men to the shore.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 17491, "quiz": 1229, "obj": "P4.REASON_SUPPORTS", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In Chapter 5, the Professor writes, \"Captain Nemo surprised me.\" What surprised him in this chapter?", "why": "الدليل الذي يسند قوله يليه مباشرة: «At times he could be cold and serious. Then he could cry for a member of his crew.»", "opts": [{"t": "The Captain was cold and serious, but then he cried for a sick man.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "The Captain was afraid of sharks, but then he walked on the ocean floor.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The Captain was kind and friendly, but then he hit a sick man.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "The Captain knew a lot about medicine, but he asked for no help.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 17492, "quiz": 1229, "obj": "P4.REASON_SUPPORTS", "kind": "relabel"}
]$spec$::jsonb;
  e jsonb; o jsonb; r record;
  v_q bigint; v_obj bigint; v_id bigint; v_key bigint; v_dx jsonb; i int; n int;
  n_done int := 0; n_skip int := 0;
begin
  /* ── الحرّاس: كلُّ سؤالٍ في اختباره، من مكتبة المادّة ٧، وما يتحوّل بلا إجابة ── */
  for r in select (x->>'q')::bigint q, (x->>'quiz')::bigint quiz from jsonb_array_elements(spec) x loop
    if not exists (select 1 from questions qq join items it on it.quiz_id = qq.quiz_id join lessons l on l.id = it.lesson_id
                    join courses c on c.id = l.course_id
                    where qq.id = r.q and qq.quiz_id = r.quiz and c.subject_id = 7 and qq.retired_at is null) then
      raise exception 'السؤال % ليس في الاختبار % من مكتبة المادّة ٧', r.q, r.quiz;
    end if;
  end loop;
  select count(*) into n from answers a
   where a.question_id in (select (x->>'q')::bigint from jsonb_array_elements(spec) x where x->>'kind' <> 'relabel');
  if n > 0 then raise exception 'على الأسئلة % إجابة — لا يُحوَّل سؤالٌ أجاب عنه أحد', n; end if;

  for e in select * from jsonb_array_elements(spec) loop
    v_q := (e->>'q')::bigint;
    select kind, body, objective_id into r from questions where id = v_q;
    select id into strict v_obj from objectives where subject_id = 7 and code = e->>'obj';

    if e->>'kind' = 'relabel' then
      if r.objective_id is distinct from v_obj then update questions set objective_id = v_obj where id = v_q; n_done := n_done + 1;
      else n_skip := n_skip + 1; end if;
      continue;
    end if;

    if r.kind = e->>'kind' and r.body = e->>'body' then n_skip := n_skip + 1; continue; end if;
    if r.kind <> e->>'was' then raise exception 'السؤال % نمطُه % لا %', v_q, r.kind, e->>'was'; end if;

    update question_keys set correct_id = null, correct_ids = null where question_id = v_q;
    delete from options where question_id = v_q;

    if e->>'kind' = 'mcq' then
      v_key := null; v_dx := '{}'::jsonb; i := 0;
      for o in select * from jsonb_array_elements(e->'opts') loop
        i := i + 1;
        insert into options (question_id, position, body) values (v_q, i, o->>'t') returning id into v_id;
        if (o->>'key')::boolean then v_key := v_id;
        elsif o->>'dx' is not null then v_dx := v_dx || jsonb_build_object(v_id::text, o->>'dx'); end if;
      end loop;
      if v_key is null then raise exception 'السؤال % بلا مفتاح', v_q; end if;
      update questions set kind = 'mcq', body = e->>'body', objective_id = v_obj where id = v_q;
      update question_keys set correct_id = v_key, correct_ids = null, accept = null, bank = null, wrong_map = null,
             dx_map = v_dx, explanation = e->>'why' where question_id = v_q;
    else   -- matching
      i := 0;
      for o in select * from jsonb_array_elements(e->'prompts') loop
        i := i + 1;
        insert into options (question_id, position, body, item_key) values (v_q, i, o->>'t', o->>'k');
      end loop;
      update questions set kind = 'matching', body = e->>'body', objective_id = v_obj, points = i where id = v_q;
      update question_keys set correct_id = null, correct_ids = null, wrong_map = null, dx_map = '{}'::jsonb,
             bank = e->'bank', accept = jsonb_build_object('pairs', e->'pairs'), explanation = e->>'why' where question_id = v_q;
    end if;
    get diagnostics n = row_count;
    if n <> 1 then raise exception 'السؤال % بلا سطر مفتاح', v_q; end if;
    n_done := n_done + 1;
  end loop;

  if n_done + n_skip <> 47 then raise exception 'عُدِّل % وتُخطّي % والمنتظر 47', n_done, n_skip; end if;
  raise notice '255: عُدِّل % سؤالاً · تُخطّي %', n_done, n_skip;
end $$;

insert into public.sql_log (n, title, applied_at)
values ('255', 'أسئلةُ كتب R10 في مكتبة بيان (٣ من ٣) — «الضغط على الجملة» و«حكمٌ ودليلُه» يصيران اختياراً من متعدّد', now())
on conflict (n) do update set applied_at = now();
